{"ticker":"CRWV","updated":"2026-11-13T23:04:48Z","profile":{"longName":"CoreWeave, Inc.","shortName":"CoreWeave, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","country":"United States","website":"https://www.coreweave.com","fullTimeEmployees":2189,"marketCap":29303138304,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-30.485777,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9641047,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":120.07895,"targetHighPrice":278.0,"targetLowPrice":39.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":38,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":1.682,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.66751,"operatingMargins":-0.00475,"profitMargins":-0.25561002,"totalRevenue":9886000128,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":138.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":40.58,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"CoreWeave, Inc. operates as a cloud infrastructure technology company in the United States, Denmark, Middle East and Asia Pacific. The company offers CoreWeave Cloud platform that comprises proprietary software and cloud services that deliver the automation and efficiency needed to manage complex artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure at scale. It also offers data and storage solutions, such as Local Object Transport Accelerator; infrastructure control solutions, including CoreWeave Kubernetes service; mission control services, including node, rack, and fleet lifecycle management; model and agent development tools comprising Weights & Biases, an AI developer platform; and runtime acceleration. In addition, the company offers graphics processing unit compute, CPU compute, networking services, managed services, and virtual and bare metal servers. Its services also include visual effects rendering, machine learning, pixel streaming, and batch processing. It has a collaboration with AdaniConneX to operate a data center in India. The company was formerly known as Atlantic Crypto Corporation and changed its name to CoreWeave, Inc. in December 2019. CoreWeave, Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Livingston, New Jersey.","summary_zh":"CoreWeave, Inc. 是一家雲端基礎設施技術公司，業務遍及美國、丹麥、中東和亞太地區。該公司提供 CoreWeave 雲端平台，由專有軟體和雲端服務組成，可提供大規模管理複雜人工智慧 (AI) 基礎設施所需的自動化和效率。它還提供資料和儲存解決方案，例如本地物件傳輸加速器；基礎設施控制解決方案，包括CoreWeave Kubernetes服務；任務控制服務，包括節點、機架和機隊生命週期管理；模型和代理開發工具，包括人工智慧開發平台 Weights & Biases；和運行時加速。此外，該公司還提供圖形處理單元運算、CPU 運算、網路服務、託管服務以及虛擬和裸機伺服器。其服務還包括視覺效果渲染、機器學習、像素流和批次。它與 AdaniConneX 合作在印度經營一個資料中心。該公司前身為 Atlantic Crypto Corporation，於 2019 年 12 月更名為 CoreWeave, Inc.。 CoreWeave, Inc. 成立於 2017 年，總部位於新澤西州利文斯頓。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 基礎設施","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":120.85,"h":121.88,"l":116.11,"c":120.47,"v":37532700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":121.47,"h":125.76,"l":115.12,"c":118.75,"v":29506800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":119.48,"h":121.84,"l":114.57,"c":120.86,"v":24420700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":122.375,"h":122.88,"l":118.2,"c":121.39,"v":21873400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":122.05,"h":129.39,"l":122.0,"c":124.86,"v":47567700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":124.69,"h":136.48,"l":119.5,"c":133.23,"v":40323400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":135.71,"h":136.0,"l":127.04,"c":130.89,"v":29126400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":132.82,"h":133.8,"l":124.06,"c":133.4,"v":26409200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":130.075,"h":138.95,"l":125.8,"c":126.66,"v":48895600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":127.915,"h":129.38,"l":119.5,"c":120.34,"v":29939300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":120.71,"h":126.5,"l":120.5,"c":122.52,"v":22532200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":136.21,"h":142.67,"l":133.22,"c":136.85,"v":71176800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":135.93,"h":137.61,"l":132.27,"c":137.05,"v":22675000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":140.5,"h":140.65,"l":134.525,"c":138.0,"v":21567600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":139.0,"h":140.55,"l":130.8,"c":134.79,"v":23405600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":137.35,"h":144.329,"l":133.78,"c":133.85,"v":26763600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":136.155,"h":138.51,"l":126.36,"c":128.83,"v":26822500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":131.98,"h":140.8,"l":131.23,"c":139.98,"v":34398800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":139.77,"h":143.69,"l":136.4